STORY

English is used only when required.

----------------------------------------
ENGINEERING SUMMARY
----------------------------------------

EXRUE=Cost of translating graph-based thought
into English.

EXTYPOS=Corruption introduced during translation.DEL TYPOS=Firewall protecting dependency chains.

EXCOST<<>>EXFRUSTRATION<<>>EXTYPOS<<>>EXCOMMUNICATIONFAILURE

